  "job_B1.3.20_20251001_193205": {
    "text": "PASSIO SANCTI ALBANI MARTYRIS.\nSVM H\u00e6\u00f0EN CASERE W\u00e6S GEHATEN DIOCLITIANVS, se w\u00e6s to casere gecoren \u00feeah\u00f0e he\nAn \u00f0\u00e6ra w\u00e6s Albanus se \u00e6\u00feela martyr, se\u00f0e on \u00fe\u00e6re ehtnysse eac wear\u00f0 acweald for Cristes geleafan,\nOn \u00feam dagum becom seo cwealmb\u00e6re ehtnyss to Engla lande fram \u00f0am arleasan casere, and \u00fea\n\u00dea \u00e6twand him an preost, se arn digollice to Albanus huse, and \u00f0\u00e6r \u00e6tlutode his la\u00f0um ehterum, and\n\u00dea began se preost swa swa he God lufode his gebedu singan and swy\u00f0e f\u00e6stan, and d\u00e6ges and nihtes\n\u00dea wunode se preost mid \u00f0am arwur\u00f0an were, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t se ealdormann \u00f0e ehte \u00f0a Cristenan hine \u00f0\u00e6r\n\u00dea comon \u00f0a \u00e6rendracan to Albanes huse, ac Albanus eode ut to \u00feam ehterum mid \u00f0\u00e6s preostes\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea gebunden and gebroht sona to \u00f0am arleasan deman, \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00f0a defollican lac his godum\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se dema deofollice gram sona swa he beseah on \u00feone so\u00f0f\u00e6stan martyr, for\u00f0an \u00fee he\nHet hine \u00fea l\u00e6dan to \u00f0am h\u00e6\u00f0engilde and cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf sceolde \u00f0a swaran wita onfon \u00fee he \u00feam\n\u00dea axode se dema ardlice and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hwylcere m\u00e6g\u00fee eart \u00feu, o\u00f0\u00f0e hwylcere manna?\n\u00d0a andwyrde Albanus \u00feam arleasan \u00feus, Hw\u00e6t belymp\u00f0 to \u00fee hwylcere m\u00e6g\u00f0e ic sy?\nAc gif \u00f0u so\u00f0 wylt gehyran ic \u00fee secge hra\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t ic Cristen eom and Crist \u00e6fre wur\u00f0ige.\nSe dema him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Cy\u00f0 me \u00feinne naman butan \u00e6lcere yldinge, nu ic axie \u00f0us.\nSe godes cempa cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam cwellere \u00feus, Ic hatte Albanus, and ic on \u00feone H\u00e6lend gelyfe, se \u00f0e is\nSe cwellere andwyrde \u00feam arf\u00e6stan were, Gif \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6s ecan lifes ges\u00e6l\u00fee habban wylt, \u00feonne ne scealt\nAlbanus him andwyrde, Eowre godas offrunga ne magon \u00fee ge deoflum offria\u00f0 eower gehelpan, ne\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a se dema deofollice yrsode, and het beswingan \u00feone halgan martyr, wende \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte his\n\u00d0a geseah se dema \u00fe\u00e6t he oferswy\u00f0an ne mihte \u00feone halgan wer mid \u00feam hetelicum witum ne fram\n\u00dea dydon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan swa swa hi het se dema, and leddon \u00f0one halgan to beheafdigenne; ac hi wurdon\nHit gelamp \u00f0a swa \u00fe\u00e6t se geleafleasa dema ungereordod s\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6re ceastra o\u00f0 \u00e6fen, butan \u00e6lcere\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Albanus efstan wolde to slege, and eode to \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fea\u00f0a he ofer \u00fea brycge ne mihte, and\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se cwellere \u00fee hine acwellan sceolde \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t wundor abryrd, and awearp his swurd arn \u00f0a\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea geanl\u00e6ht mid anr\u00e6dum geleafan, to \u00f0am halgan were \u00fee he beheafdian sceolde; and \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r gehende \u00feam halgan w\u00e6re an myrige dun mid wyrtum amet, mid eallre f\u00e6gernysse and\n\u00dea eode albanus ardlice \u00f0yder, and b\u00e6d sona \u00e6t Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he him sealde w\u00e6ter uppan \u00f0\u00e6re dune, and\n\u00de\u00e6r arn \u00fea wylspryncg \u00e6t Albanes fotum \u00fe\u00e6t men mihton tocnawan his mihte wi\u00f0 God, \u00fea \u00f0a se\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea beheafdod for \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman uppan \u00f0\u00e6re dune, and to his Drihtne ferde mid\nHi beheafdodon sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feone so\u00f0f\u00e6stan cempan \u00fee nolde beheafdian \u00f0one halgan wer, and he l\u00e6g mid\nEft \u00f0a \u00f0a cwelleras comon to heora hlaforde, and hi s\u00e6don \u00fea syllican tacna \u00f0e Albanus worhte, and\nOn \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan ehtnysse wurdon ofslagene Aaron and Iulius, and o\u00f0re manega, wera and wifa, wide\nSeo ehtnys geswac \u00f0a, and eoden \u00fea Cristenan of wudum and of w\u00e6stenum \u00fe\u00e6r hi w\u00e6ron behydde,\nHi worhton eac \u00fea wur\u00f0lice cyrcan \u00feam halgan Albane \u00f0\u00e6r he bebyrged w\u00e6s, and \u00fe\u00e6r wurdon\n\u00deis w\u00e6s geworden \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6t gewinn come \u00f0urh Hengest and Horsan \u00fee hyndon \u00f0a Bryttas, and se\nSy wuldor and lof \u00feam welwillendan scyppende se\u00f0e ure f\u00e6deras feondum \u00e6tbr\u00e6d, and to fulluhte\nAMEN.\nITEM ALIA, ACITOFEL ET ABSALON.\nIS NV EAC to witenne \u00fe\u00e6t man witna\u00f0 foroft \u00f0a arleasan scea\u00f0an and \u00fea swicolan \u00f0eofas, ac hi\nWolde huru se earming hine sylfne be\u00feencan, and his synna geandettan mid so\u00f0re behreowsunge, huru\nSe H\u00e6lend him andwyrde, So\u00f0 ic \u00fee secge nu tod\u00e6g \u00feu bist mid me on neorxnawange.\n\u00deus geearnode se arleasa scea\u00f0a, on his dea\u00f0es \u00ferowunge \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif mid Criste, for\u00f0an \u00f0e he gelyfde\nYfele de\u00f0 him sylfum \u00fee mid swicdome his tila\u00f0, and he bi\u00f0 scea\u00f0ena gefera \u00fee man sceandlice\nSe swicola bedyddra\u00f0 his d\u00e6da wi\u00f0 menn, ac hi beo\u00f0 geopenode oft un\u00feances, huru on domes d\u00e6g,\nSe scea\u00f0a bi\u00f0 nu ofslagen and to sceame getucod, and his earme sawl sy\u00f0\u00f0an sy\u00f0a\u00f0 to helle to \u00f0am\nWe wena\u00f0 swa\u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t se eallwealdenda h\u00e6lend wille gemiltsian \u00feam manfullan scea\u00f0an, gif he mid\nAc se swicola deofol \u00fee beswac \u00f0one \u00feeof, and \u00e6fre forl\u00e6rde o\u00f0 his lifes ende, nele naht ea\u00f0e on his\nEac swylce hlafordswican losia\u00f0 on ende swa swa us bec secga\u00f0 so\u00f0lice gehw\u00e6r.\nSum woruldwita w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e wis on r\u00e6de, Acitofel gehaten, mid Dauide \u00feam cynincge \u00fee gode w\u00e6s\n\u00dea w\u00e6s se Acitofel mid Absalone on r\u00e6de, and r\u00e6dde him sona hu he beswican mihte his agenne\n\u00dea gebealh hine Acitofel and mid bealwe wear\u00f0 afylled, for\u00f0an \u00fee his r\u00e6d ne moste \u00feam re\u00f0an\nSwa geendode se wita his w\u00e6lhreowe ge\u00feeaht, se\u00f0e wolde ber\u00e6dan his rihtwisan hlaford.\nAbsalon \u00f0a ferde for\u00f0 mid his unr\u00e6de, and wolde his agenum f\u00e6der feores ben\u00e6man and habban his\nHe rad \u00f0a on his mule mid mycelre fyrde \u00feurh \u00e6nne heahne holt mid hetelicum ge\u00feance, \u00fea gefeng\nSwa geendode se f\u00e6derswica mid his feore his unr\u00e6d.\nEall swa eac Iudas \u00f0e w\u00e6lhreowlice bel\u00e6wde urne H\u00e6lend Crist, acwealde hine sylfne hangiende on\n\u00c6lc man bi\u00f0 eac fordemed \u00fee hine sylfne adyt, and \u00e6lc agenslaga a on ecnysse \u00f0rowa\u00f0, and\nEall swa \u00fea unrihtwisan deman \u00fee heora domas awenda\u00f0 \u00e6fre be \u00feam sceattum na be so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse,\nSe rihtwisa dema sceall deman \u00e6fre riht, and fyr\u00f0rian \u00fea rihtwisnysse for Godes lufon symle, for\u00f0an\nNe sceall nan Godes \u00feegn for sceattum riht deman, ac healdan \u00feone dom gif he Drihtnes man sy,\nSume menn sylla\u00f0 eac cyrcan to hyre swaswa waclice mylna, \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6re Godes hus \u00fee w\u00e6s Gode\nGescylde us se scyppend \u00fee gesceop us to mannum wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s deofles swicdom \u00fee syrw\u00f0 embe us, and",
